  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "A maximum of EUR 2,000 for articles, book chapters and conference papers, and EUR 6,000 for monographs can be applied for subject to the following conditions:\n\nWe especially recommend this funding option for open-access books and open-access journals with which ETH-Bibliothek does not have an agreement on the funding of publication fees , such asNature CommunicationsorScientific Reports.\n\nETH-Bibliothek's takes care of the application process for members of ETH Zurich.\n\nFP7 post-grant Open Access Pilot"
    }
